  "download_disabled": false,
  "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\">This data-set is post-processed from two Perturb-seq experiments - one genome-wide screen and another targeted screen - conducted in multiple iPSC lines, described in (https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.1101/2024.11.28.625833v1). For each screen (fitness genes, non-fitness genes and targeted screen), the following files are available:</p><p><br></p><ul><li>RNA UMI Counts</li><li>Guide UMI Counts</li><li>Cell Metadata</li></ul><p></p>",
